  "description": "Lee Kang-hoon: South Korea's air pistol national athlete, world rank #1, and a superstar in the sports industry sought after by marketers everywhere.\n\nIt's a grand title, but to me, he was just a cute younger neighbor and childhood friend whom I considered a real younger brother.\n\nAt least, until he confessed his feelings to me for the first time at age 16...\n\nAfter rejecting him over and over and over as he constantly hovered around me, that annoying kid who brazenly stuck by my side even into adulthood... is suddenly starting to feel like a man...?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1561018716)",
